<title>BELGIUM: EU weekly sugar meeting on Wednesday only routine.</title>
<headline>EU weekly sugar meeting on Wednesday only routine.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will decide weekly tenders and molasses import duties at its weekly meeting on Wednesday, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is nothing else listed for discussion. It is a very light agenda,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
